<pre>

Updated March, 2006.


Name: The Blades of the Spider Queen
Command: spider
Creator: Dragoness
Your level: 14
Maximum level: 30


Description:
The Blades of the Spider Queen are a group of religious fanatics, who worship
spiders and especially the Queen of Spiders. The goal of this sect of fanatics
is unknown to all, except the Queen of Spiders and possibly the highest
ranking members of the Order, but anyone who worships as disgusting things
like spiders is not doing anything good.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be evil_religious (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 Receive bonuses as you advance
 May train skill Attack to 14%
 May train skill Consider to 23%
 May train skill Discipline to 4%
 May train skill Hiding to 9%
 May train skill Short blades to 9%
 May train skill Combat sense to 9%
 May train skill Stunned maneuvers to 4%
 May train skill First aid to 14%
 May train skill Throw weight to 9%
